    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010031"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "やっぱりそうか。知り合いか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010040,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん！　友達！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010040"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010050,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ、そっかぁ……！\r\nねえねえプロデューサー、今読んでも大丈夫？",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010050"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、いいぞ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010060,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やったー！　ありがとう！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010060"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010070,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それでね、きっとなんだけど……\r\nお手紙読んだら、そのこと話したくなっちゃうから……",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_shy",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010070"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010080,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、話聞いてくれる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "もちろん。俺でよければ\r\n友達のこと、聞かせてほしい",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010090,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへっ、うん！　読んでくるね……！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010090"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "俺は書類仕事してるから、\r\n読み終わったら声掛けてくれ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "急ぎのものじゃないし、\r\n遠慮しなくていいからな",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010100,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ふふっ、はーい！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
