    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おっ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010120,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "聞いて聞いてー！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010120"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "おう、なんて書いてあったんだ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010130,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "えへへ、あのね……！",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010130"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010140,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "アイドルやってるわたしのこと\r\nたまたま知ったんだって！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010140"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010150,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "それで、びっくりしてお手紙くれたらしくて……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010150"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは……すごい偶然だな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010160,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサーもそう思う！？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010160"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010170,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "もうもう、わたしもびっくりしちゃって！\r\nそれでね！　イルミネのこと、調べてくれたみたいで……！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010170"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010180,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "初めてファンレター書いたよ！　とか\r\n元気そうでよかったとか",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010180"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010190,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "この歌が笑顔になれて好きとか\r\nあとあと、よかったら連絡ほしいなとか……！",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010190"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010200,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "あっ！　そうそう！\r\nこの子、今度日本に来るんだって！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010200"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010210,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "日本に行ったら会いたいなって書いてくれてて……！\r\nわたしも！　って伝えて会う日とか相談したいなって！",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010210"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010220,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "こういう時の連絡って、\r\n最初は手紙の方がいいのかな！？",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_surp",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010220"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010230,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "電話はいつ出られるかわからないし、\r\n知らない番号からってびっくりしちゃうかもだよね！？",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010230"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010240,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "やっぱりメッセが一番なのかな？\r\nでも──",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_sad",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010240"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ちょ、ちょっと落ち着けめぐる\r\nその子が日本に来るのって、すぐなのか？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010250,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ううん、まだ具体的には決まってないみたいだよ\r\nもしわたしのお休みが合えば調整できるって書いてあった！",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charAnim3": "no",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010250"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010260,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "だから、お手紙ありがとうってまずは伝えたいなって！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010260"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうか……それなら",
    "textCtrl": "l",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "select": "手紙を返したら？",
    "nextLabel": "1"
  },
  {
    "select": "電話はどうだ？",
    "nextLabel": "2"
  },
  {
    "textCtrl": "cm",
    "select": "メッセは？",
    "nextLabel": "3"
  },
  {
    "label": "1",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐる、ファンレターって貰うとどうだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010270,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "すーっごく嬉しい！",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010270"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それは、どうして？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010280,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "便箋とか、ペンの色とか、文字以外でも、\r\nいっぱい気持ちがこもってるってわかるから！",
    "charAnim1": "touch",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010280"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010290,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "……！　そっか！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010290"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010300,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "わたし、お手紙出すことにする！\r\nすーっごくこだわったお手紙！",
    "charAnim1": "anger1",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010300"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010310,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "プロデューサー、ありがとー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010310"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "2",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "時差があるから、\r\nタイミングは難しいかもしれないけど",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "めぐるは国際電話も身近だろうし",
    "charAnim1": "think",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy2_s",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010320,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "電話！　やっぱり直接話せるのいいよね！",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010320"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "そうだな。声って言葉を伝えるだけじゃないし、\r\nめぐるにピッタリだと思うんだ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "それに、めぐるは友達と電話、好きだろ？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010330,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "うん、大好き！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010330"
  },
  {
    "id": 2003009010340,
    "speaker": "めぐる",
    "text": "ありがとうプロデューサー、電話するよー！",
    "charAnim1": "smile3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/200300901/2003009010340"
  },
  {
    "textFrame": "off",
    "nextLabel": "end"
  },
  {
    "label": "3",
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "今時、海外宛でも無料のツールも多いし、\r\nメッセも確かそうだよな？",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLabel": "meguru",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
